#==============================================================================================
#
#   animation_effect_2 - Animations::AnimationEffect: phases, progress and the update context
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Animations/AnimationEffect.cpp (lines 461-865), by region p4a:
#       whether an effect is in play, current or in effect; the boundary times and the before,
#       active, after and idle phases; the overall, directed, simple iteration and transformed
#       progress, the current direction and iteration; parsing an easing string; the
#       constructor, initialize and visit_edges; and AnimationUpdateContext's destructor, which
#       applies the invalidations the animated properties need. Part 1 has the timing
#       properties and the times.
